/-! # `Baladi_Dynamical_Zeta_Functions_and_Dynamical_Determinants_for_Hyperbolic_Maps`

Transfer operators of hyperbolic basic sets on the anisotropic spaces `B^{t,s}` of Baladi's
book *Dynamical Zeta Functions and Dynamical Determinants for Hyperbolic Maps* (Chapters 4–5) and
of Baladi–Tsujii: fake unstable leaves, the local and manifold spaces, their compact embeddings,
pressure bounds, and the deterministic leading spectral data. -/
